padding:96px 0 52px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(18,37,31,0),var(--deep) 80px)}.salus-cp .hero-text{max-width:640px}}\n@media(max-width:1024px){.salus-cp .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n@media(max-width:900px){.salus-cp .trust{flex-direction:column;gap:6px}}\n@media(max-width:760px){.salus-cp .wrap{padding:0 20px}.salus-cp section{padding:56px 0}.salus-cp .split,.salus-cp .grid,.salus-cp .pgrid,.salus-cp .finishes,.salus-cp .temp-stats,.salus-cp .contrast .duo,.salus-cp .loki-points{grid-template-columns:1fr}.salus-cp .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.salus-cp .btn{justify-content:center}.salus-cp .btns .btn{flex:1 1 100%}}\n</style>\n{%- comment -%}\n  COLD PLUNGE GUIDE (/pages/cold-plunge-guide). Una sola seccion Custom Liquid.\n  Fotos del hero y de la serie Loki: Shopify Files (links fijos).\n  Fotos y precios de los productos salen de Shopify en vivo.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign cp_ice = all_products['salus-ice-bath'] -%}\n{%- assign cp_snow = all_products['snowpiercer'] -%}\n{%- assign cp_dyn = all_products['dynamic'] -%}\n<div class=\"salus-cp\">\n  <header class=\"hero\">\n    <img class=\"hero-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&amp;width=1500\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&amp;width=750 750w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&amp;width=1100 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&amp;width=1500 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&amp;width=2048 2048w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 60vw, 100vw\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1360\" fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a black Loki cold plunge on a sunlit terrace at sunset\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hero-text\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">The Salus guide to cold immersion</span>\n      <h1>The home cold plunge guide.<br>A daily reset.</h1>\n      <p>A moment of cold. A ritual that's yours. Explore what cold immersion offers, learn how to begin safely, and find the right cold plunge tub for your home.</p>\n      <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#cp-collection\">Find your cold plunge</a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#cp-essentials\">Explore the guide <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"trust\"><span>✓ Expert product guidance</span><span>✓ Free shipping on select models*</span></div>\n    </div></div></div>\n  </header>\n  <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"On this page\"><div class=\"wrap\"><a href=\"#cp-essentials\"><span>01</span>The essentials</a><a href=\"#cp-benefits\"><span>02</span>The benefits</a><a href=\"#cp-collection\"><span>03</span>Find your plunge</a><a href=\"#cp-loki\"><span>04</span>Loki Series</a><a href=\"#cp-start\"><span>05</span>Getting started</a><a href=\"#cp-contrast\"><span>06</span>Contrast therapy</a><a href=\"#cp-faq\"><span>07</span>Your questions</a></div></nav>\n\n  <section class=\"intro\" id=\"cp-essentials\"><div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / The essentials</span><h2>More than an ice bath. A space to come back to you.</h2></div>\n    <div><p class=\"lead\">Whether it's a simple ice bath tub or a cold plunge with a chiller, the idea is the same: a brief immersion in cold water. Simple in principle, intentional in practice. From a post-workout routine to a quiet moment outdoors, it's a way to bring a different kind of ritual home.</p><p>Unlike an ice-filled bathtub, a purpose-built plunge gives you a dedicated space, and models with a chiller hold the water at the temperature you set. Less preparation, more room for consistency.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"#cp-start\">Start with the basics →</a></div>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section id=\"cp-benefits\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Why people plunge</span><h2>A little cold. A different perspective.</h2><p class=\"lead\">Here's the appeal, and what the research actually supports.</p>\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"num\">Recovery</span><h3>After a workout</h3><p>Cold-water immersion may help reduce perceived muscle soreness after exercise. Timing matters, especially if building muscle is your goal.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"num\">Alertness</span><h3>An invigorating moment</h3><p>Many people say they feel more alert after a plunge. That immediate feeling is not the same as a proven, lasting mental-health benefit.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"num\">Routine</span><h3>A ritual of your own</h3><p>A dedicated plunge gives you a place to pause and be intentional. Choose a routine that fits your life, not a temperature or time to compete with.</p></article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"temp\"><h3>How cold should a cold plunge be?</h3>\n      <div class=\"temp-stats\"><div><strong>50–59°F (10–15°C)</strong><span>A safe starting range for beginners</span></div><div><strong>1–2 minutes</strong><span>A good length for first sessions</span></div><div><strong>40°F · 5 min</strong><span>Limits to respect: never colder, never longer</span></div></div>\n      <p>Colder and longer are not better. Build up gradually, follow your tub's instructions, and get out if you feel unwell. Source: <a href=\"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/what-to-know-about-cold-plunges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cleveland Clinic</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">Evidence for benefits to immunity, weight loss, and long-term mood is still limited. Read the <a href=\"https://health.clevelandclinic.org/what-to-know-about-cold-plunges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cleveland Clinic's cold plunge guidance</a>.</p>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"products\" id=\"cp-collection\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"phead\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Find your plunge</span><h2>Find your cold plunge.</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:0\">Thoughtfully selected, made for your space and your everyday. Want a cold plunge with a chiller? Every model here except the Ice Bath holds the temperature you set from a Wi-Fi app; the Ice Bath keeps it simple with water and ice.</p></div><div class=\"cp-nav\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/cold-plunges\">Shop all cold plunge tubs →</a><button type=\"button\" data-cp-dir=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous cold plunges\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" data-cp-dir=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next cold plunges\">›</button></div></div>\n    <div class=\"cp-track\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Cold plunge models\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      {%- assign cp_list = 'salus-ice-bath|THE EVERYDAY RESET|A straightforward starting point for cold immersion at home: fill it with water and ice, no chiller needed.|Salus Saunas Ice Bath cold plunge tub with a wood exterior and steps~glacier-cold-plunge-tub|THE COMPACT ROUND|A compact round plunge with a Thermo-Pine exterior, a 124-gallon fiberglass interior, and a Wi-Fi cold/heat chiller.|Glacier round cold plunge tub with a Thermo-Pine exterior, gray fiberglass interior, and a half-round step~alpine-cold-plunge-tub|ROOM FOR TWO|A 200-gallon plunge built for two, with a thermo-treated wood exterior, matching stairs, and a Wi-Fi cold/heat chiller.|Alpine oval cold plunge tub with a thermo-treated wood exterior, gray fiberglass interior, and matching stairs~snowpiercer|THE CEDAR CLASSIC|Pacific cedar, a compact barrel profile, and a Wi-Fi cold/heat chiller you control from your phone.|Snowpiercer cedar barrel cold plunge tub with a stainless-steel interior and steps~eclipse-cold-plunge-tub-stainless|THE BLACK BARREL|A sleek black barrel with a low-upkeep synthetic wood exterior, a stainless steel or PVC interior, and a Wi-Fi cold/heat chiller.|Eclipse black barrel cold plunge tub with a stainless-steel interior and step-up stairs~dynamic|ROOM TO MAKE IT YOURS|A sleek stainless-steel-lined tub with a Wi-Fi chiller, available in two rectangular sizes.|Dynamic rectangular cold plunge tub with stainless-steel lining and a separate chiller unit~vortex-cold-plunge-tub|BUILT FOR RECOVERY|A 180-gallon stainless steel tub in a red cedar skirt, with a chiller and heater that range from 34°F to 108°F.|Vortex rectangular cold plunge tub with a stainless-steel tub, cedar skirt, and cedar backrest' | split: '~' -%}\n      {%- for row in cp_list -%}{%- assign f = row | split: '|' -%}{%- assign product = all_products[f[0]] -%}{%- if product.id -%}\n      <a class=\"pcard\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 760px) 82vw, 33vw', alt: f[3] }}<div class=\"pbody\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ f[1] }}</span><h3>{{ product.title }}</h3><p>{{ f[2] }}</p><div class=\"price\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}<small>USD</small>{% if product.compare_at_price_min > product.price_min %}<s>{{ product.compare_at_price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</s>{% endif %}</div><span class=\"link\">Explore this plunge →</span></div></a>\n      {%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n      <thead><tr><th>Choose what matters to you</th><th>Salus Saunas Ice Bath</th><th>Snowpiercer Cold Plunge</th><th>Dynamic Cold Plunge</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Starting price</td><td>{{ cp_ice.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</td><td>{{ cp_snow.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</td><td>From {{ cp_dyn.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Form &amp; footprint</td><td>Ice bath · thermally modified wood exterior</td><td>Barrel · Pacific cedar · 42″ wide</td><td>Rectangle · 50″ or 55″ long · stainless-steel lining</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Water and ice (no chiller needed)</td><td>1 HP cold/heat chiller · Wi-Fi app</td><td>1 HP cold/heat chiller · Wi-Fi app</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Best place to begin</td><td>A lower entry price</td><td>A cedar barrel look</td><td>Two rectangular size options</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table></div>\n    <p class=\"note\">*Free curbside shipping to the 48 contiguous U.S. states on the Ice Bath, Snowpiercer, and Dynamic. Additional fees may apply elsewhere. Current pricing, options, and availability are confirmed on each product page.</p>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"loki\" id=\"cp-loki\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\">\n      <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">04 / The Salus luxury collection</span><h2>The Loki Series.</h2><p>A cold plunge with presence. Expressive finishes and architectural lines, for a wellness space that feels entirely your own.</p>\n        <div class=\"loki-points\"><div><h3>A considered palette</h3><p>From luminous white to richly veined black, choose a finish that belongs in your space.</p></div><div><h3>Beauty in the contrast</h3><p>Pair the warmth of Thermo Ash wood with a stone-look finish, or choose uninterrupted stone-look lines all over.</p></div></div>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/collections/loki-series\">Discover the Loki Series</a></div>\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1365\" height=\"1365\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/image-1791897244466.jpg?v=1791897263&amp;width=1200\" alt=\"Loki Thermo Ash-Invisible White cold plunge with a white interior and dark wood exterior in a woodland setting\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"finishes\">\n      {%- assign cp_loki = 'thermo-ash-desir-noir|Rich wood tones and dramatic dark veining.|Loki Thermo Ash-Desir Noir cold plunge tub with fluted dark wood sides and a black veined stone-look top~thermo-ash-invisible-white|Warm wood tones and a luminous white finish.|Loki Thermo Ash-Invisible White cold plunge tub with fluted wood sides and a white stone-look top~calacatta-black|A sculptural silhouette with striking black veining.|Loki Calacatta Black cold plunge tub in a black veined stone-look finish' | split: '~' -%}\n      {%- for row in cp_loki -%}{%- assign f = row | split: '|' -%}{%- assign product = all_products[f[0]] -%}{%- if product.id -%}\n      <a class=\"finish\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 33vw', alt: f[2] }}<div><h3>{{ product.title | remove: 'Loki ' | remove: ' Cold Plunge' }}</h3><p>{{ f[1] }}</p></div></a>\n      {%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\" style=\"color:#cfdcd8\">Make it personal. <a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/loki-series\">Explore every Loki finish →</a></p>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section id=\"cp-start\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">05 / Your first plunge</span><h2>Start gently. Make it intentional.</h2><p class=\"lead\">You don't need to go colder or stay longer to prove anything. Your first priority is a safe, comfortable introduction.</p>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3>Check in first</h3><p>Ask a healthcare professional whether cold immersion is right for you, especially if you have a heart condition or other health concerns.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3>Prepare your space</h3><p>Use a stable, accessible tub. Keep a towel nearby, keep the exit clear, and have someone with you.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3>Ease into the cold</h3><p>Enter gradually, keep your head above water, and breathe normally. Avoid holding your breath or hyperventilating.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3>Listen, then warm up</h3><p>Keep it brief. Get out if you feel unwell, then dry off and warm up gradually. Never ignore warning signs.</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Cold is powerful. Treat it with respect.</strong>Cold shock can cause gasping and a rapid rise in heart rate and blood pressure. Never plunge alone or after drinking alcohol. This guide is educational, not medical advice. Always consult with your doctor if you have any serious health questions. Read <a href=\"https://www.health.harvard.edu/heart-health/cold-plunges-healthy-or-harmful-for-your-heart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Harvard Health's safety guidance</a>.</div>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"contrast\" id=\"cp-contrast\"><div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">06 / The other half of your ritual</span><h2>Contrast therapy: pairing sauna heat with cold plunge immersion.</h2><p>Build a wellness space with both ends of the spectrum. A sauna and a cold plunge offer two distinct experiences, designed around how you like to unwind.</p><h3 class=\"routine-title\">A simple contrast routine</h3><ol class=\"routine\"><li><strong>Heat:</strong> 10–20 minutes in your sauna, at a temperature you find comfortable.</li><li><strong>Cool down:</strong> Step out, rest, or rinse for a minute or two.</li><li><strong>Cold:</strong> 1–3 minutes in the cold plunge, in the 50–59°F range. First-timers: a minute or two.</li><li><strong>Rest &amp; repeat:</strong> 1–2 rounds, depending on how you feel. Warm up gradually at the end.</li></ol><p class=\"note\">Switching between heat and cold puts additional stress on your heart. Get medical guidance before trying contrast therapy and avoid abrupt, extreme temperature changes.</p><div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/pages/home-sauna-buyers-guide\">Read the sauna buyer's guide</a></div></div>\n    <div class=\"duo\"><div class=\"warm\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Heat</span><h3>Sauna</h3><p>Traditional, <a href=\"/collections/all-infrared-saunas\">infrared</a>, or hybrid warmth to relax and unwind, for <a href=\"/collections/indoor-saunas\">indoor spaces</a> or <a href=\"/collections/outdoor-saunas\">outdoor retreats</a>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/collections/all-saunas\">Explore saunas →</a></p></div><div class=\"cold\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Cold</span><h3>Cold plunge</h3><p>A brief, invigorating immersion to close your ritual.</p><p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"#cp-collection\">Find your plunge →</a></p></div></div>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section id=\"cp-faq\"><div class=\"wrap faq\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">07 / A little more clarity</span><h2>Good questions. Thoughtful answers.</h2><p class=\"lead\">From your first session to your final choice. Still deciding? Call a Salus specialist at <a class=\"link\" href=\"tel:+18882870111\">(888) 287-0111</a>.</p>\n    <details><summary>What is a cold plunge?</summary><p>A cold plunge is a short immersion in cold water, usually in a dedicated tub, an ice bath, or another controlled setting. A purpose-built tub with a chiller lets you manage water temperature without relying on bags of ice. It is a wellness practice, not a treatment or a substitute for medical care.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>How cold should a cold plunge be?</summary><p>There is no single temperature that is right for everyone, and colder is not automatically better. Cleveland Clinic suggests beginners start between 50 and 59°F (10–15°C) and never go below 40°F (4°C). Ask a healthcare professional about personal risks and follow your tub's instructions.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>How long should you cold plunge?</summary><p>Keep it short. Cleveland Clinic suggests beginners limit sessions to a minute or two and that a session should never go longer than five minutes. Get out right away if you feel dizzy, numb, unwell, or unable to control your breathing.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>What are the benefits of a cold plunge?</summary><p>Cold-water immersion may help reduce perceived muscle soreness after exercise, and some people feel more alert afterward. Evidence for lasting improvements in mood, immunity, weight loss, or overall health is still limited. Regular cold immersion right after strength training may interfere with muscle-building adaptations.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>Can I use a cold plunge after a sauna?</summary><p>Some people pair sauna sessions and cold immersion as contrast therapy. Moving abruptly between heat and cold can stress the cardiovascular system, so get medical advice first, allow yourself to cool down, and avoid extreme temperatures. Always consult with your doctor if you have any serious health questions.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>Do I need a chiller, or can I use ice?</summary><p>Ice can cool a basic tub, but it needs replenishing and gives you less precise control. The Salus Saunas Ice Bath is designed for a simple water-and-ice fill. The Snowpiercer and Dynamic include a 1 HP cold/heat chiller with Wi-Fi control that holds the temperature you set; check each product page for current inclusions.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>What should I check before installing a cold plunge?</summary><p>Confirm your available space, the filled weight and surface support, drainage, service access, and weather exposure. Chiller models such as the Snowpiercer and Dynamic need a dedicated 120 V, 15 amp outlet with GFCI protection. Follow the owner's manual and use a qualified electrician when needed.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>Where does Salus Saunas ship cold plunges?</summary><p>The Ice Bath, Snowpiercer, and Dynamic include free curbside shipping to the 48 contiguous United States. Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, and island deliveries may require a custom quote or additional fees. Confirm current delivery timing and availability with Salus before ordering.</p></details>\n  </div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Make room for your reset</span><h2>Your next ritual starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Let's find the right plunge for your space, your goals, and your everyday.</p>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/collections/cold-plunges\">Shop cold plunges</a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+18882870111\">Call (888) 287-0111</a></div>\n  </div></section>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.getElementById('cp-collection');if(!r)return;var t=r.querySelector('.cp-track'),b=r.querySelectorAll('[data-cp-dir]');if(!t||b.length<2)return;function u(){b[0].disabled=t.scrollLeft<=4;b[1].disabled=t.scrollLeft+t.clientWidth>=t.scrollWidth-4}b.forEach(function(x){x.addEventListener('click',function(){t.scrollBy({left:(+x.dataset.cpDir)*t.clientWidth*0.9,behavior:'smooth'})})});t.addEventListener('scroll',u,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('resize',u);u();})();</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Cold Plunge Guide\",\"item\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/cold-plunge-guide\"}]},{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/cold-plunge-guide#article\",\"headline\":\"The Home Cold Plunge Guide\",\"description\":\"How to choose a cold plunge tub for your home: ice bath vs. chiller models, safe beginner temperatures, contrast therapy with a sauna, and the Loki Series.\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/cold-plunge-guide\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0720/7695/1854/files/hf_20260929_170101_f19ab5f8-d718-471c-bd08-e33b4777c5bb.png?v=1791897011&width=1500\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"datePublishe