should never go longer than five minutes. Get out right away if you feel dizzy, numb, unwell, or unable to control your breathing.\"}},\n{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the benefits of a cold plunge?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cold-water immersion may help reduce perceived muscle soreness after exercise, and some people feel more alert afterward. Evidence for lasting improvements in mood, immunity, weight loss, or overall health is still limited. Regular cold immersion right after strength training may interfere with muscle-building adaptations.\"}},\n{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use a cold plunge after a sauna?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Some people pair sauna sessions and cold immersion as contrast therapy. Moving abruptly between heat and cold can stress the cardiovascular system, so get medical advice first, allow yourself to cool down, and avoid extreme temperatures. Always consult with your doctor if you have any serious health questions.\"}},\n{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a chiller, or can I use ice?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Ice can cool a basic tub, but it needs replenishing and gives you less precise control. The Salus Saunas Ice Bath is designed for a simple water-and-ice fill. The Snowpiercer and Dynamic include a 1 HP cold/heat chiller with Wi-Fi control that holds the temperature you set; check each product page for current inclusions.\"}},\n{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What should I check before installing a cold plunge?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Confirm your available space, the filled weight and surface support, drainage, service access, and weather exposure. Chiller models such as the Snowpiercer and Dynamic need a dedicated 120 V, 15 amp outlet with GFCI protection. Follow the owner's manual and use a qualified electrician when needed.\"}},\n{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where does Salus Saunas ship cold plunges?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Ice Bath, Snowpiercer, and Dynamic include free curbside shipping to the 48 contiguous United States. Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, and island deliveries may require a custom quote or additional fees. Confirm current delivery timing and availability with Salus before ordering.\"}}\n]}]}</script>",
